ol diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications \u2022 Engaged in completing a four-year degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or MIS. \u2022 Experience with Python, React, or JavaScript (academic or professional). \u2022 Ability to work independently and in a team setting. \u2022 Exposure to full-stack development. \u2022 Exposure to Circuit Vision ticket tracking software. \u2022 Familiarity with automated reporting, dashboard creation, and API integration. \u2022 Interest in telecom systems, service availability, and network configuration. \u2022 Familiarity with circuit design layouts and router configuration. \u2022 Strong communication and organizational skills. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment, including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) df497e4e Last Name (required) c101bfe2 Email (required) 58c4bf9b Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) da4fd666 Last Name (required) 28877f27 Email (required) 5f18685d Job Alert 5074c8cb Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your 