ffectively, take direction, and possess initiative to accomplish assigned tasks Preferred Qualifications \u2022 Bachelor\u2019s Degree in Engineering or related field \u2022 5 years of related experience \u2022 Work is completed in-person and onsite in Wichita, KS Physical Requirements Ability to lift and carry up to 25 lbs Apply Now First Name (required) c2a7b543 Last Name (required) cf89e394 Email (required) 67766cfb Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) abc20c1a Last Name (required) 2da4f78e Email (required) 1de18e20 Job Alert 5034dc63 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 6bef47cf Last Name (required) fe1b4f1a Email (required) 03876ca7 Send This Job To: 6f6c8496 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State Unive