work area. \u2022 Perform any other duties as assigned to support production operations. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements \u2022 Previous experience in a leadership or supervisory role (1yr. preferred). \u2022 Strong communication and interpersonal skills \u2022 Ability to effectively lead and motivate a team. \u2022 Detail-oriented with a focus on quality and accuracy \u2022 Ability to work in a fast-paced environment and handle multiple tasks simultaneously. \u2022 Proficiency in Microsoft Office applications (Excel, Word, Outlook) Preferred Qualifications \u2022 High school diploma or equivalent \u2022 Availability to work flexible hours, Monday through Friday between 5 am \u2013 9 pm, including weekends if required. \u2022 Reliable transportation \u2022 Must be able to sit for long periods and walk long distances. \u2022 Experience in a manufacturing or production environment \u2022 Knowledge of production processes and workflow management \u2022 College degree in a related field but not necessary \u2022 People management skills Apply Now First Name (required) 7c6a7238 Last Name (required) 4a33577e Email (required) 8e898b28 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 4ec9dc11 Last Name (required) 0c9e3ffb Email (required) 97d7e92d Job Alert a01efe6e Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) Natl Inst fo