tion SAP Business Systems Analyst - Wichita, Kansas, United States Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm | Temporary Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst 499815 Temporary Department Ennovar Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 Per Hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Flexible Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a \u201cU.S. Citizen\u201d. Job Story Ennovar is looking for a SAP Business Systems Analysts to work at Textron Aviation. Job Duties Support SAP functional and technical teams across Finance, Supply Chain, Manufacturing, Customer Support, and other business functions. Assist with gathering and documenting business requirements. Help analyze and troubleshoot SAP issues and user access requests. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to understand business processes and identify improvement opportunities. Participate in testing system enhancements, upgrades, and process improvements. Document development objects in accordance with audit requirements. Support project activities, including testing, documentation, and user training. Research SAP functionality and industry best practices to recommend solutions. Use AI and automation tools, including Microsoft Copilot, to improve productivity and streamline repetitive tasks. Additional Requirements Interest in SAP systems, enterprise business applications, and business process improvement. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Ability to communicate effectively and collaborate with cross-functional teams. Attention to detail when documenting requirements, testing results, and technical information. Willingness to learn SAP functionality and assist with system troubleshooting and user support. Ability to research potential solutions and learn AI and automation tools, including Microsoft Copilot. Additional Information Work is done on site at Textron Aviation West Campus. Physical Requirements Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information Apply Now First Name (required) 77360aaf Last Name (required) 9b79d170 Email (required) 868b7da8 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 739ebd3c Last Name (required) e22d2a3e Email (required) 76986c29 Job Alert 95e6b045 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 19308b6b Last Name (required) 7d6a3ffe Email (required) af931ee7 Send This Job To: db6fb939 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text