elp maintain a safe, supportive, and inclusive learning environment Required Education This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and/or preferences. Additional Requirements This position requires work in Haysville, KS Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and/or preferences. Preferred Qualifications - Passion for working with youth - Strong communication skills - Ability to work collaboratively in a team setting - Reliable, punctual, and adaptable Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 280b2b47 Last Name (required) 72132ed3 Email (required) 16fdc57e Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 6ee54c90 Last Name (required) 374d0fc2 Email (required) 3e9500d5 Job Alert bc10dd69 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) Strategic Engagement & Planning Strategic Engagement & Planning Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & dat