s, gaining experience in multiple areas of the library, including Circulation, Stacks, and Interlibrary Loan. Not sure if Wichita is right for you? Sign up to receive emails from our Talent team to learn more about what it's like working here. First Name (required) 1ca940e5 Last Name (required) 30ae160d Email (required) 118afa33 Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Close Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, we have no access to or control over these cookies. I do not accept I accept Please choose a department(s)"}, "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/deloitte-smart-factory-support-student-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {"title": "Deloitte Smart Factory Support Student Assistant", "description": "Deloitte Smart Factory Support Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Deloitte Smart Factory Support Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Deloitte Smart Factory Support Student Assistant Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm | Student Deloitte Smart Factory Support Student Assistant 496368 Student Department Ennovar Tech Services and Solutions Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $14 - $18 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Ennovar is looking for an outstanding student to work at Deloitte's The Smart Factory on Innovation Campus to help with smart factory technologies. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties \u2022 Assist with planning and logistics for client tours of The Smart Factory @ Wichita, ensuring a curated experience tailored to client goals. \u2022 Support the development and implementation of Smart Factory use cases in collaboration with Deloitte\u2019s Innovation Campus operations. \u2022 Assist with testing, integration, and maintenance of line components, systems, and quality control processes. \u2022 Contribute to the creation of work instructions and quality inspection protocols for various manufacturing cells on the production line. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements \u2022 Currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science; strong interest in Data Science preferred. Must be enrolled at Wichita State University for the duration of employment. \u2022 Strong interest in supply chain, operations, and Industry 4.0 technologies. \u2022 Ability to grasp and explain supply chain concepts and smart manufacturing strategies. \u2022 Demonstrated analytical and critical thinking skills. \u2022 Professional demeanor with strong character and executive presence. \u2022 Effective communicator, including in virtual or remote environments. \u2022 Ability to troubleshoot and resolve issues related to systems, processes, and development tools. \u2022 Familiarity with process improvement methods (e.g., Lean, Six Sigma). \u2022 Business acumen (basic understanding of accounting, finance, etc.). \u2022 Proficient in problem-solving with a process-oriented mindset. \u2022 Basic coding knowledge is a plus, but not required. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment, including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 144336a0 Last Name (required) 6a0480e2 Email (required) 0550f2e0 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) d99132df Last Name (required) 931ebd6a Email (required) 12fef730 Job Alert 89875a58 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) cfe66bf1 Last Name (required) 04b5aa33 Em