 they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Assist the NIAR Full Scale staff with a variety of assignments critical to tasks in support of customer projects. Tasking may include meeting support, front desk management, mailroom, freight shipping, facility maintenance tasks, escort of vendors. Tasks may include general business operations tasks if qualified and experienced. Assist Full Scale shop staff with test setup build and facility maintenance. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements The work is 100% on site at the NIAR ASTEC Coliseum facility in Park City KS. Additional Information Mix of shop and office tasks, in conditioned and unconditioned spaces. Applicant should be able to lift and safely climb in and out of test fixtures. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 167718b3 Last Name (required) feb2ae12 Email (required) 95a5457c Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 286df079 Last Name (required) 99492893 Email (required) 7fe18d43 Job Alert 9fb44a13 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Departm